01:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9440327286720276,"text_excerpt":"The only time I'm at this location is for our fantasy football draft, which means we receive a dedicated server, koozies, pens, and keychains since we rent out space. We always receive great service too. Food is decent - guys love the wings and pizza. Husband and I ordered cheese fries, which were good, but ranch was weird tasting (we are both Ranch connoisseurs lol). Overall, this is a great place to grab a quick bite, beer, and watch the game."},{"business_id":"QHFpMJeBTQJfzdDvsB9oqA","review_id":"oUJQncMmt8VxFACdKHqTQg","date":"2015-07-21T03:32:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387397766113281,"text_excerpt":"If you want a very clean, smoke free place with reliable & cordial staff, a ton of pool tables & absent the loud music, check out Fox & Hound. Sure, they have bar food--it's a bar! But it's really good bar food if you ask me. The fish & chips is good (my choice there) and they're roast beef (French dip) has a good taste too. Salsa has a good flavor as well. One of the best bars for sitting and watching a game, too--it's very pretty & fancy :). Staff never has a snide attitude and will pay attention to you."},{"business_id":"QHFpMJeBTQJfzdDvsB9oqA","review_id":"UvKVAVL2KVWYt6JLbr4uIA","date":"2013-01-19T16:18:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9253709316253662,"text_excerpt":"Good food, good atmosphere, good prices. This place I'd a notch above your average pub fare. And they have NESN on the big screens got all you Northern sports fans on NOLA. Nothing fancy, no pretense, but good, affordable, comfortable fare.. Go with some friends, watch the game, enjoy some grub..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
